      <Docs>
        <param name="rateOfPerceivedExertion">Value is between 0.0f and 10.0f inclusive</param>
        <summary>Sets rate of perceived exertion (RPE) used during the exercise segment.</summary>
        <returns>To be added.</returns>
        <remarks>
          <para>Sets rate of perceived exertion (RPE) used during the exercise segment. Values correspond to the Borg CR10 RPE scale and must be in the range 0 to 10 inclusive. 0: No exertion (at rest) 1: Very light 2-3: Light 4-5: Moderate 6-7: Hard 8-9: Very hard 10: Maximum effort Returns builder instance with rate of perceived exertion set.</para>
          <para><format type="text/html"><a href="https://developer.android.com/reference/android/health/connect/datatypes/ExerciseSegment.Builder#setRateOfPerceivedExertion(float)" title="Reference documentation">Android reference for <code>android.health.connect.datatypes.ExerciseSegment.Builder.setRateOfPerceivedExertion</code>.</a></format></para>
